# The originals only - tens of megabytes of phone photographs that nothing in
# the build reads. public/process/ is deliberately NOT ignored: the deploy runs
# npm run build and nothing else, so the resized copies have to be committed or
# every photograph on the live site is a broken image. See tools/prep-photos.py.
photos-src/
